        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Analysis&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Analysis will be done on the customers who didn&#39;t use the Free Bet:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Which channel was used to send this offer? Email? SMS? Social?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- What was the value of these customers before they were long term lapsed?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Did they bet on specific sports?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Were they actually more active on the gaming products?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Did this customer have a bet nearly being placed in their basket but forgot to finalise this action? Could a reminder comm be sent for this?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="547" y="720" width="280" height="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" edge="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" source="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-14" target="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-15">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1330" y="440" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Analysis:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Now that a customer is activated again, we need to see how we can obtain value from them again as that customer now has a negative P/L to the business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Analysis Needs to be done on what was successful from this customer reactivated:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Did this customer reactivate from Email? SMS?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- What were the successful CTR metrics from each comm?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Which Sport did he play on?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- What were the odds on the bet placed?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- How much did the customer win from their bet?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="870" y="330.25" width="340" height="359.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Lifecycle:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Lifecycle Journey for customers to consolidate their position as active customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;This Journey would exclude customers from daily BAU campaigns for a specific period until we&#39;re happy they are fully monetised players.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We&#39;d split this journey by metrics of HV/MV/LV based off previous betting history and potentially how much the person won.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="350" width="330" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-22" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1" source="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-19" target="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-103">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2615" y="350" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cb6bSvUKwpR6El5IvKav-19" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Data:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;This would be a script to bring through customers that have reactivated and won their FB.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;We would co-ordinate with the data science team and look to potentially bring through a machine learning model that looks at the customer metrics such as:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Money won on the FB used&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Betting history pre-long term lapsed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Sports betting history&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Offers used when active:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Were they more Matched Bets? Power Tokens? Deposit Bonuses?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
